Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test(claude-eval): G258-8 alias receipt coherence across
 policies

Anchors (initial generation, live target) validated; a host-held seen set
refuses replay across verifications; the classifier's epoch window applies
to receipts too; verdicts stay monotonic under other clocks and graces and
never exceed REVIEW_CANDIDATE.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rv89UzspoLREq2u9UkZssh
